Cell["\<\
This interface is defined only for operations returned by MSGCorep. It is not \
a general converter for arbitrary lists that merely resemble MSGCorep data.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"0720f698-f654-429d-8c51-0057dd0f2e1e"],

Cell["\<\
Each returned record contains the MSGCorep label, its rotation matrix, \
fractional translation, and MagneticTB's \"F\"/\"T\" unitary flag. The \
function also prints the primitive lattice vectors supplied by SpaceGroupIrep.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ad85f57e-4437-4d9f-8e98-b5b1a1943540"],

Cell["\<\
MSGCorep and SpaceGroupIrep are optional external Mathematica applications. \
The user must load MSGCorep explicitly with Needs[\"MSGCorep`\"] before \
calling this function; MagneticTB does not load it automatically.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5c4f0843-0005-434a-b386-c6f1d08a9029"],

Cell["\<\
getMSGElemFromMSGCorep returns $Failed and issues a message when MSGCorep or \
its SpaceGroupIrep dependency has not already been loaded. It does not repair \
the input or switch to an approximate fallback.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"d3678a6e-3f6b-42bb-a4c1-433d3ddae777"]
}, Closed]],

